{"content":"Implemented the file-completion fix for `.gitignore` patterns such as `.*`.\n\n### Changes\n- Prevented `ListDirectory` from applying ignore rules to the traversal root itself.\n- Ignore rules still apply normally to all child files and directories.\n- Added a regression test confirming:\n  - Regular files are returned with a `.*` ignore pattern.\n  - Hidden files and `.gitignore` remain excluded.\n  - The scan is not truncated.\n\n### Verification\nAttempted `go test ./internal/fsext` and a formatting check. The test was canceled by fail-fast when the formatting check could not start because `gofmt` is unavailable in the environment. The changed Go code was manually checked for standard formatting, but automated tests could not be completed.","type":"text"}
